{"case_id": "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q11", "domain": "family", "question": "命主出身及家庭情况？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，年柱癸亥为偏财坐正财，月柱丙辰为正印坐劫财，日主己土生于辰月得令，但时柱丁卯七杀贴身，形成印星化杀生身之局。年柱偏财透出，代表父亲为经商或企业主，但年柱与月柱财印相克，暗示父亲与家庭关系有波折。时柱七杀为忌，主早年家庭变动或父亲健康问题。结合1983年出生，1986年（丙寅年）流年正印被合，寅亥合木加重七杀，且卯辰相害，可能应父亲之灾。母亲星为偏财（癸水），但月干丙火正印透出，代表母亲持家有道，且印星护身，母亲守寡不改嫁的可能性较大。兄弟姐妹方面，月支辰中藏乙木七杀为兄弟，时支卯木为姐妹，故有一姐一弟。综合判断，最符合D选项描述。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q11", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4436, "response_id": "ea218df0-aaa7-4296-a417-84994cb683ec", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 284, "completion_tokens": 228, "total_tokens": 512, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 284}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q12", "domain": "career", "question": "命主的样貌、性情、爱好及职业？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析：\n\n日主己土生于辰月，得月令之助，但地支卯木双现，木旺克土，时柱丁火生土，整体身偏弱。命局中木气过盛，主肝胆、筋骨方面易有隐患，且卯为四肢之象，双卯冲克日主，暗示腿脚或行动方面可能有先天或后天的损伤。年柱癸亥水旺，水木相生，更助木势，加重了木克土的力量，命主早年身体可能较弱。\n\n性情上，木旺之人多固执、有主见，但土弱受克，内心易有压抑感，行为可能显得古怪或不合群。时柱丁火偏印透出，主艺术、音乐方面的天赋和兴趣，偏印也代表非主流爱好，如古典音乐、小众艺术等。日支卯木为七杀，主竞争、叛逆，但被火化，转为艺术表达。\n\n职业方面，食伤（火）生财（土），但木旺克土，不宜稳定坐班，更适合自由职业或艺术类。萨克斯乐手和乐团老板符合火（表演、艺术）与土（管理、经营）的组合，且木为四肢，若腿脚有疾，更可能转向音乐而非体力劳动。\n\n综合判断，选项A最符合命局特征。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q12", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6018, "response_id": "86a816ae-9b79-4eb7-a374-97a0812e77f8", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 282, "completion_tokens": 296, "total_tokens": 578, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 282}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
